      "explanation": "<p>Let's consider each species in List I and determine their geometries/shapes.</p>\n<p>A. <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.877ex\" height=\"2.129ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -775.2 2597.7 940.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(783,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(1186.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(811,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>: This ion is formed by the addition of a proton to a water molecule. The central atom (O) is surrounded by three Hydrogen atoms and one lone pair, making its shape pyramidal.</p>\n<p>B. Acetylide anion: The acetylide ion (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.75ex\" height=\"2.093ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -775.2 2541.7 925.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(1158.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(783,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> or <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.673ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.866ex\" height=\"2.669ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -882.5 1708.7 1179.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(755,411.6) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(755,-297.3) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) has a linear geometry as the three atoms are in a straight line.</p>\n<p>C. <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.69ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.826ex\" height=\"2.554ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -823.8 2133.1 1128.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1533,411.6) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1533,-305.1) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>: The ammonium ion has a central nitrogen atom surrounded by four hydrogen atoms, giving it a tetrahedral geometry.</p>\n<p>D. <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.626ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.455ex\" height=\"2.537ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -844.3 2411.1 1121.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1811,432.1) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1811,-276.9) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>: The chlorite ion has a central chlorine atom surrounded by two oxygen atoms and one lone pair, which gives it a bent or V-shaped geometry.</p>\n<p>Matching these to List II, we get:</p>\n<p>A. <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.877ex\" height=\"2.129ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -775.2 2597.7 940.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(783,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(1186.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(811,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> - III. Pyramidal<br><br>\nB. Acetylide anion - II. Linear<br><br>\nC. <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.69ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.826ex\" height=\"2.554ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -823.8 2133.1 1128.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1533,411.6) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1533,-305.1) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> - I. Tetrahedral<br><br>\nD. <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.626ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.455ex\" height=\"2.537ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -844.3 2411.1 1121.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1811,432.1) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1811,-276.9) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> - IV. Bent</p>"
